{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And your terumah-offering shall be reckoned to you.</b> To bring blessing upon your household, even though it was measured. For they said (Berakhot): 'If one measured and afterward blessed, that is a vain prayer.' Nevertheless, the terumah of tithe brings a blessing of good upon the rest of the tithe, which remains profane in the Levite's hand."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:20.615645272Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}